      <div class="blog-rich-content" style="border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 18px; background-color: #ffffff; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6; color: #0f172a;">
        <h2><strong>Table&nbsp;of&nbsp;Contents</strong></h2><ol><li>Quick&nbsp;Answer</li><li>Can&nbsp;Arts&nbsp;Students&nbsp;Learn&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analytics?</li><li>Why&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analytics&nbsp;Is&nbsp;Becoming&nbsp;Popular&nbsp;After&nbsp;12th</li><li>Can&nbsp;You&nbsp;Do&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analytics&nbsp;Without&nbsp;a&nbsp;Maths&nbsp;Background?</li><li>Skills&nbsp;You&nbsp;Need&nbsp;to&nbsp;Become&nbsp;a&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analyst</li><li>Best&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analytics&nbsp;Course&nbsp;Options&nbsp;After&nbsp;12th&nbsp;Arts</li><li>Comparison&nbsp;Table:&nbsp;Course&nbsp;Types&nbsp;After&nbsp;12th&nbsp;Arts</li><li>Step-by-Step&nbsp;Roadmap&nbsp;to&nbsp;Become&nbsp;a&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analyst&nbsp;After&nbsp;12th</li><li>Real&nbsp;Student&nbsp;Example:&nbsp;From&nbsp;Arts&nbsp;Stream&nbsp;to&nbsp;Analytics&nbsp;Career</li><li>Career&nbsp;Scope&nbsp;and&nbsp;Salary&nbsp;in&nbsp;India</li><li>Common&nbsp;Challenges&nbsp;Arts&nbsp;Students&nbsp;Face</li><li>Best&nbsp;Platforms&nbsp;to&nbsp;Learn&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analytics&nbsp;in&nbsp;India</li><li>FAQs</li><li>Final&nbsp;Thoughts</li><li>SEO&nbsp;Notes</li></ol><h2><strong>Quick&nbsp;Answer:</strong></h2><p><strong>TL;DR:</strong></p><p>&nbsp;Yes,&nbsp;arts&nbsp;students&nbsp;can&nbsp;become&nbsp;data&nbsp;analysts&nbsp;after&nbsp;12th&nbsp;in&nbsp;2026.&nbsp;You&nbsp;don&#39;t&nbsp;necessarily&nbsp;need&nbsp;science&nbsp;or&nbsp;advanced&nbsp;maths.&nbsp;Start&nbsp;with&nbsp;beginner-friendly&nbsp;courses&nbsp;covering&nbsp;Excel,&nbsp;Power&nbsp;BI,&nbsp;SQL,&nbsp;and&nbsp;basic&nbsp;statistics.&nbsp;With&nbsp;practical&nbsp;skills&nbsp;and&nbsp;projects,&nbsp;arts&nbsp;students&nbsp;can&nbsp;build&nbsp;strong&nbsp;careers&nbsp;in&nbsp;analytics,&nbsp;business&nbsp;intelligence,&nbsp;and&nbsp;reporting&nbsp;roles.</p><h2><strong>Can&nbsp;Arts&nbsp;Students&nbsp;Learn&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analytics?</strong></h2><p>Yes,&nbsp;you&nbsp;can&nbsp;absolutely&nbsp;pursue&nbsp;a&nbsp;<strong><a href="https://www.nidads.com/course/diploma-in-data-analytics-and-ai" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">data&nbsp;analytics&nbsp;course&nbsp;after&nbsp;12th&nbsp;arts</a></strong>&nbsp;in&nbsp;2026.&nbsp;Most&nbsp;beginner-level&nbsp;data&nbsp;analytics&nbsp;courses&nbsp;do&nbsp;not&nbsp;require&nbsp;advanced&nbsp;mathematics&nbsp;or&nbsp;a&nbsp;science&nbsp;background.&nbsp;What&nbsp;matters&nbsp;more&nbsp;is&nbsp;your&nbsp;willingness&nbsp;to&nbsp;learn&nbsp;tools,&nbsp;logical&nbsp;thinking,&nbsp;and&nbsp;basic&nbsp;data&nbsp;interpretation&nbsp;skills.</p><p>We&#39;ve&nbsp;seen&nbsp;many&nbsp;students&nbsp;from&nbsp;arts&nbsp;and&nbsp;commerce&nbsp;backgrounds&nbsp;enter&nbsp;analytics&nbsp;through&nbsp;certification&nbsp;courses,&nbsp;diplomas,&nbsp;and&nbsp;practical&nbsp;projects.&nbsp;The&nbsp;industry&nbsp;now&nbsp;values&nbsp;skills&nbsp;more&nbsp;than&nbsp;stream&nbsp;selection&nbsp;in&nbsp;many&nbsp;entry-level&nbsp;roles.</p><h2><strong>Why&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analytics&nbsp;Is&nbsp;Becoming&nbsp;Popular&nbsp;After&nbsp;12th</strong></h2><p>A&nbsp;few&nbsp;years&nbsp;ago,&nbsp;most&nbsp;students&nbsp;thought&nbsp;analytics&nbsp;was&nbsp;only&nbsp;for&nbsp;engineering&nbsp;or&nbsp;science&nbsp;graduates.&nbsp;That’s&nbsp;changing&nbsp;quickly.</p><p>Data&nbsp;is&nbsp;an&nbsp;asset,&nbsp;and&nbsp;every&nbsp;business&nbsp;relies&nbsp;on&nbsp;data&nbsp;across&nbsp;every&nbsp;industry.&nbsp;So,&nbsp;if&nbsp;you&nbsp;have&nbsp;skills&nbsp;in&nbsp;managing&nbsp;data&nbsp;and&nbsp;analysing&nbsp;it&nbsp;to&nbsp;drive&nbsp;more&nbsp;useful&nbsp;insights&nbsp;that&nbsp;actually&nbsp;contribute&nbsp;to&nbsp;your&nbsp;overall&nbsp;business,&nbsp;you&nbsp;have&nbsp;a&nbsp;bright&nbsp;future.&nbsp;Companies&nbsp;demand&nbsp;professionals&nbsp;who&nbsp;can&nbsp;interpret&nbsp;data&nbsp;and&nbsp;explain&nbsp;insights&nbsp;clearly.&nbsp;And&nbsp;if&nbsp;you&nbsp;belong&nbsp;to&nbsp;an&nbsp;arts&nbsp;background,&nbsp;then&nbsp;you&nbsp;already&nbsp;have&nbsp;strong&nbsp;communication&nbsp;and&nbsp;storytelling&nbsp;skills&nbsp;that&nbsp;are&nbsp;required&nbsp;for&nbsp;an&nbsp;analytics&nbsp;role.&nbsp;</p><p>According&nbsp;to&nbsp;Statista,&nbsp;the&nbsp;global&nbsp;big&nbsp;data&nbsp;market&nbsp;is&nbsp;expected&nbsp;to&nbsp;cross&nbsp;massive&nbsp;growth&nbsp;figures&nbsp;by&nbsp;2027.&nbsp;In&nbsp;India,&nbsp;analytics&nbsp;hiring&nbsp;has&nbsp;also&nbsp;grown&nbsp;rapidly&nbsp;because&nbsp;startups&nbsp;and&nbsp;companies&nbsp;need&nbsp;data-driven&nbsp;decision-making.</p><p>A&nbsp;report&nbsp;by<u><a href="https://nasscom.in/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">&nbsp;NASSCOM</a></u>&nbsp;stated&nbsp;that&nbsp;India’s&nbsp;data&nbsp;analytics&nbsp;sector&nbsp;continues&nbsp;to&nbsp;create&nbsp;thousands&nbsp;of&nbsp;new&nbsp;job&nbsp;opportunities&nbsp;every&nbsp;year.&nbsp;Entry-level&nbsp;hiring&nbsp;has&nbsp;especially&nbsp;increased&nbsp;in&nbsp;reporting&nbsp;and&nbsp;dashboard-based&nbsp;roles.</p><p>That’s&nbsp;why&nbsp;many&nbsp;students&nbsp;now&nbsp;search&nbsp;for:</p><ul><li>“How&nbsp;can&nbsp;I&nbsp;become&nbsp;data&nbsp;analyst&nbsp;after&nbsp;12th”</li><li>“High&nbsp;salary&nbsp;courses&nbsp;after&nbsp;12th&nbsp;arts”</li><li>“Can&nbsp;arts&nbsp;student&nbsp;do&nbsp;data&nbsp;science”</li></ul><p>And&nbsp;honestly,&nbsp;those&nbsp;are&nbsp;valid&nbsp;questions.</p><h2><strong>Can&nbsp;You&nbsp;Do&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analytics&nbsp;Without&nbsp;a&nbsp;Maths&nbsp;Background?</strong></h2><p>This&nbsp;is&nbsp;probably&nbsp;the&nbsp;biggest&nbsp;fear&nbsp;arts&nbsp;students&nbsp;have.</p><p>The&nbsp;short&nbsp;answer?&nbsp;Yes.</p><p>You&nbsp;do&nbsp;need&nbsp;some&nbsp;basic&nbsp;mathematical&nbsp;understanding,&nbsp;but&nbsp;you&nbsp;do&nbsp;not&nbsp;need&nbsp;hardcore&nbsp;calculus&nbsp;or&nbsp;engineering-level&nbsp;maths&nbsp;for&nbsp;beginner&nbsp;analytics&nbsp;jobs.</p><p>Most&nbsp;beginner&nbsp;courses&nbsp;focus&nbsp;on:</p><ul><li>Basic&nbsp;statistics</li><li>Percentages</li><li>Charts&nbsp;and&nbsp;graphs</li><li>Logical&nbsp;thinking</li><li>Pattern&nbsp;analysis</li></ul><p>Modern&nbsp;tools&nbsp;do&nbsp;most&nbsp;calculations&nbsp;automatically.&nbsp;Your&nbsp;job&nbsp;is&nbsp;often&nbsp;to&nbsp;interpret&nbsp;the&nbsp;data&nbsp;and&nbsp;explain&nbsp;what&nbsp;it&nbsp;means.</p><p>That’s&nbsp;why&nbsp;many&nbsp;learners&nbsp;successfully&nbsp;study&nbsp;<strong>data&nbsp;analytics&nbsp;without&nbsp;maths&nbsp;background</strong>&nbsp;experience.</p><h3><strong>What&nbsp;Actually&nbsp;Matters&nbsp;More?</strong></h3><h4><strong>Communication&nbsp;Skills</strong></h4><p>A&nbsp;good&nbsp;analyst&nbsp;explains&nbsp;data&nbsp;clearly.&nbsp;Arts&nbsp;students&nbsp;often&nbsp;perform&nbsp;well&nbsp;here&nbsp;because&nbsp;they&nbsp;already&nbsp;practice&nbsp;writing,&nbsp;research,&nbsp;and&nbsp;interpretation.</p><h4><strong>Curiosity</strong></h4><p>Analytics&nbsp;is&nbsp;about&nbsp;asking:</p><ul><li>Why&nbsp;did&nbsp;sales&nbsp;drop?</li><li>Which&nbsp;campaign&nbsp;worked&nbsp;better?</li><li>What&nbsp;do&nbsp;customers&nbsp;prefer?</li></ul><h4><strong>Tool&nbsp;Knowledge</strong></h4><p>If&nbsp;you&nbsp;know&nbsp;Excel,&nbsp;SQL,&nbsp;Power&nbsp;BI,&nbsp;and&nbsp;basic&nbsp;visualization,&nbsp;you&#39;re&nbsp;already&nbsp;ahead&nbsp;of&nbsp;many&nbsp;beginners.</p><p><strong><em>Read&nbsp;more:&nbsp;<u><a href="https://www.nidads.com/blog/data-science-career-india-2026" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Data&nbsp;science&nbsp;career&nbsp;in&nbsp;2026</a></u></em></strong></p><h2><strong>Skills&nbsp;You&nbsp;Need&nbsp;to&nbsp;Become&nbsp;a&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analyst</strong></h2><p>You&nbsp;don’t&nbsp;need&nbsp;to&nbsp;learn&nbsp;everything&nbsp;at&nbsp;once.</p><p>Start&nbsp;with&nbsp;foundational&nbsp;tools&nbsp;first.</p><h3><strong>1.&nbsp;Excel</strong></h3><p>Excel&nbsp;is&nbsp;still&nbsp;heavily&nbsp;used&nbsp;in&nbsp;Indian&nbsp;companies.&nbsp;Many&nbsp;entry-level&nbsp;reporting&nbsp;jobs&nbsp;rely&nbsp;on&nbsp;it&nbsp;daily.</p><p>Learn:</p><ul><li>Pivot&nbsp;tables</li><li>Charts</li><li>Lookup&nbsp;formulas</li><li>Data&nbsp;cleaning</li></ul><p>According&nbsp;to<u><a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">&nbsp;Microsoft&nbsp;Learn</a></u>,&nbsp;Excel&nbsp;remains&nbsp;one&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;most&nbsp;demanded&nbsp;business&nbsp;tools&nbsp;globally.</p><h3><strong>2.&nbsp;SQL</strong></h3><p>SQL&nbsp;helps&nbsp;you&nbsp;retrieve&nbsp;data&nbsp;from&nbsp;databases.</p><p>Even&nbsp;beginner&nbsp;analysts&nbsp;are&nbsp;expected&nbsp;to&nbsp;know:</p><ul><li>SELECT&nbsp;statements</li><li>Filters</li><li>Joins</li><li>Basic&nbsp;aggregations</li></ul><p>Don’t&nbsp;worry&nbsp;—&nbsp;SQL&nbsp;looks&nbsp;scary&nbsp;at&nbsp;first&nbsp;but&nbsp;becomes&nbsp;easy&nbsp;with&nbsp;practice.</p><h3><strong>3.&nbsp;Power&nbsp;BI&nbsp;or&nbsp;Tableau</strong></h3><p>Visualization&nbsp;tools&nbsp;help&nbsp;transform&nbsp;raw&nbsp;numbers&nbsp;into&nbsp;dashboards.</p><p>Power&nbsp;BI&nbsp;is&nbsp;especially&nbsp;popular&nbsp;in&nbsp;India&nbsp;because:</p><ul><li>It&#39;s&nbsp;affordable</li><li>Easy&nbsp;for&nbsp;beginners</li><li>Widely&nbsp;used&nbsp;by&nbsp;companies</li></ul><h3><strong>4.&nbsp;Basic&nbsp;Statistics</strong></h3><p>You&nbsp;only&nbsp;need&nbsp;practical&nbsp;understanding&nbsp;initially:</p><ul><li>Mean</li><li>Median</li><li>Percentages</li><li>Trends</li><li>Correlation&nbsp;basics</li></ul><p>No&nbsp;need&nbsp;to&nbsp;panic&nbsp;about&nbsp;complex&nbsp;formulas.</p><h3><strong>5.&nbsp;Problem&nbsp;Solving</strong></h3><p>Real&nbsp;analytics&nbsp;work&nbsp;is&nbsp;often&nbsp;business-focused.</p><p>For&nbsp;example:</p><p>&nbsp;A&nbsp;restaurant&nbsp;chain&nbsp;may&nbsp;ask:</p><p>&nbsp;“Which&nbsp;branch&nbsp;performs&nbsp;best&nbsp;during&nbsp;weekends?”</p><p>You&nbsp;analyze&nbsp;the&nbsp;data&nbsp;and&nbsp;present&nbsp;insights.</p><h2><strong>Best&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analytics&nbsp;Course&nbsp;Options&nbsp;After&nbsp;12th&nbsp;Arts</strong></h2><p>There&nbsp;are&nbsp;several&nbsp;learning&nbsp;paths&nbsp;available&nbsp;today.</p><h3><strong>Degree&nbsp;Courses</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>BBA&nbsp;in&nbsp;Business&nbsp;Analytics:&nbsp;</strong>Best&nbsp;for&nbsp;those&nbsp;students&nbsp;who&nbsp;want&nbsp;a&nbsp;full&nbsp;college&nbsp;degree&nbsp;with&nbsp;analytics&nbsp;exposure.&nbsp;</li><li><strong>BCA&nbsp;with&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analytics:&nbsp;</strong>Right&nbsp;for&nbsp;you&nbsp;if&nbsp;you&nbsp;want&nbsp;to&nbsp;learn&nbsp;technical&nbsp;tools&nbsp;step&nbsp;by&nbsp;step.&nbsp;</li><li><strong>BA&nbsp;with&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science&nbsp;Electives:&nbsp;</strong>Many&nbsp;universities&nbsp;offer&nbsp;hybrid&nbsp;programs&nbsp;that&nbsp;combine&nbsp;your&nbsp;degree&nbsp;subjects&nbsp;with&nbsp;practical&nbsp;analytics.&nbsp;</li></ul><h3><strong>Diploma&nbsp;Courses&nbsp;After&nbsp;12th&nbsp;Arts</strong></h3><p>Diploma&nbsp;programs&nbsp;are&nbsp;becoming&nbsp;popular&nbsp;because&nbsp;they&nbsp;are&nbsp;shorter&nbsp;and&nbsp;skill-focused.</p><p>These&nbsp;are&nbsp;useful&nbsp;for&nbsp;students&nbsp;searching:</p><ul><li>“Diploma&nbsp;courses&nbsp;after&nbsp;12th&nbsp;arts”</li><li>“Job-oriented&nbsp;courses&nbsp;after&nbsp;arts”</li></ul><p>Typical&nbsp;duration:</p><ul><li>6&nbsp;months&nbsp;to&nbsp;1&nbsp;year</li></ul><p>Focus&nbsp;areas:</p><ul><li>Excel</li><li>SQL</li><li>Power&nbsp;BI</li><li>Data&nbsp;visualization</li></ul><h2><strong>Comparison&nbsp;Table:&nbsp;Course&nbsp;Types&nbsp;After&nbsp;12th&nbsp;Arts</strong></h2><p class="ql-align-center"><strong>Course&nbsp;Type</strong></p><p class="ql-align-center"><strong>Duration</strong></p><p class="ql-align-center"><strong>Average&nbsp;Fees</strong></p><p class="ql-align-center"><strong>Best&nbsp;For</strong></p><p class="ql-align-center"><strong>Placement&nbsp;Support</strong></p><p>Diploma&nbsp;in&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analytics</p><p>6–12&nbsp;months</p><p>₹30,000–₹80,000</p><p>Skill-focused&nbsp;learners</p><p>Moderate</p><p>BBA&nbsp;in&nbsp;Business&nbsp;Analytics</p><p>3&nbsp;years</p><p>₹1–4&nbsp;lakh</p><p>Degree&nbsp;+&nbsp;business&nbsp;knowledge</p><p>Good</p><p>Online&nbsp;Certification</p><p>3–8&nbsp;months</p><p>₹5,000–₹60,000</p><p>Budget&nbsp;learners</p><p>Depends&nbsp;on&nbsp;platform</p><p>BCA&nbsp;with&nbsp;Analytics</p><p>3&nbsp;years</p><p>₹1.5–5&nbsp;lakh</p><p>Technical&nbsp;career&nbsp;path</p><p>Strong</p><p>Bootcamp&nbsp;Programs</p><p>4–9&nbsp;months</p><p>₹50,000–₹2&nbsp;lakh</p><p>Fast-track&nbsp;job&nbsp;seekers</p><p>High</p><p></p><h2><strong>Step-by-Step&nbsp;Roadmap&nbsp;to&nbsp;Become&nbsp;a&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analyst&nbsp;After&nbsp;12th</strong></h2><h3><strong>Step&nbsp;1:&nbsp;Learn&nbsp;Excel&nbsp;Basics</strong></h3><p>Start&nbsp;with&nbsp;Excel&nbsp;because&nbsp;it&nbsp;builds&nbsp;confidence&nbsp;quickly.</p><p>Spend&nbsp;2–3&nbsp;weeks&nbsp;learning:</p><ul><li>Data&nbsp;formatting</li><li>Sorting</li><li>Basic&nbsp;formulas</li><li>Charts</li></ul><p>This&nbsp;creates&nbsp;your&nbsp;foundation.</p><h3><strong>Step&nbsp;2:&nbsp;Learn&nbsp;SQL</strong></h3><p>Once&nbsp;comfortable&nbsp;with&nbsp;spreadsheets,&nbsp;move&nbsp;to&nbsp;SQL.</p><p>Practice&nbsp;beginner&nbsp;database&nbsp;queries&nbsp;daily.</p><p>&nbsp;You’ll&nbsp;start&nbsp;understanding&nbsp;how&nbsp;companies&nbsp;store&nbsp;and&nbsp;organize&nbsp;data.</p><h3><strong>Step&nbsp;3:&nbsp;Learn&nbsp;Power&nbsp;BI</strong></h3><p>This&nbsp;is&nbsp;where&nbsp;things&nbsp;become&nbsp;exciting.</p><p>You’ll&nbsp;create&nbsp;dashboards&nbsp;that&nbsp;look&nbsp;professional&nbsp;and&nbsp;visually&nbsp;impressive.</p><p>Many&nbsp;recruiters&nbsp;shortlist&nbsp;candidates&nbsp;simply&nbsp;because&nbsp;they&nbsp;can&nbsp;showcase&nbsp;dashboard&nbsp;projects.</p><h3><strong>Step&nbsp;4:&nbsp;Build&nbsp;Small&nbsp;Projects</strong></h3><p>Don’t&nbsp;only&nbsp;watch&nbsp;tutorials.</p><p>Create&nbsp;projects&nbsp;like:</p><ul><li>Instagram&nbsp;engagement&nbsp;dashboard</li><li>E-commerce&nbsp;sales&nbsp;report</li><li>Student&nbsp;attendance&nbsp;analysis</li></ul><p>Projects&nbsp;matter&nbsp;more&nbsp;than&nbsp;certificates&nbsp;in&nbsp;many&nbsp;interviews.</p><h3><strong>Step&nbsp;5:&nbsp;Create&nbsp;LinkedIn&nbsp;and&nbsp;Portfolio</strong></h3><p>A&nbsp;lot&nbsp;of&nbsp;students&nbsp;ignore&nbsp;this.</p><p>Recruiters&nbsp;often&nbsp;search&nbsp;LinkedIn&nbsp;before&nbsp;contacting&nbsp;candidates.&nbsp;Share&nbsp;projects&nbsp;regularly&nbsp;and&nbsp;explain&nbsp;what&nbsp;insights&nbsp;you&nbsp;discovered.</p><p>We&#39;ve&nbsp;seen&nbsp;beginners&nbsp;get&nbsp;internships&nbsp;simply&nbsp;because&nbsp;their&nbsp;project&nbsp;explanations&nbsp;looked&nbsp;practical.</p><h3><strong>Step&nbsp;6:&nbsp;Apply&nbsp;for&nbsp;Internships</strong></h3><p>Start&nbsp;early.</p><p>Even&nbsp;unpaid&nbsp;internships&nbsp;can&nbsp;help&nbsp;you&nbsp;gain:</p><ul><li>Real&nbsp;datasets</li><li>Business&nbsp;understanding</li><li>Resume&nbsp;credibility</li></ul><p>Internships&nbsp;make&nbsp;a&nbsp;huge&nbsp;difference&nbsp;during&nbsp;placements.</p><h2><strong>Career&nbsp;Scope&nbsp;and&nbsp;Salary&nbsp;in&nbsp;India</strong></h2><p>Analytics&nbsp;roles&nbsp;are&nbsp;expanding&nbsp;across&nbsp;industries.</p><h3><strong>Entry-Level&nbsp;Roles</strong></h3><p>After&nbsp;a&nbsp;<strong>data&nbsp;analytics&nbsp;course&nbsp;after&nbsp;12th&nbsp;arts</strong>,&nbsp;you&nbsp;can&nbsp;target:</p><ul><li>Junior&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analyst</li><li>MIS&nbsp;Executive</li><li>Reporting&nbsp;Analyst</li><li>Business&nbsp;Analyst&nbsp;Intern</li><li>Dashboard&nbsp;Executive</li></ul><h3><strong>Average&nbsp;Salaries&nbsp;in&nbsp;India</strong></h3><p class="ql-align-center"><strong>Experience&nbsp;Level</strong></p><p class="ql-align-center"><strong>Estimated&nbsp;Salary</strong></p><p>Fresher</p><p>₹2.5–5&nbsp;LPA</p><p>2–4&nbsp;Years</p><p>₹6–10&nbsp;LPA</p><p>Senior&nbsp;Analyst</p><p>₹12–18&nbsp;LPA</p><p>According&nbsp;to&nbsp;Glassdoor&nbsp;India&nbsp;and&nbsp;AmbitionBox,&nbsp;analytics&nbsp;salaries&nbsp;continue&nbsp;to&nbsp;rise&nbsp;because&nbsp;skilled&nbsp;professionals&nbsp;remain&nbsp;in&nbsp;demand.</p><p>That’s&nbsp;why&nbsp;many&nbsp;students&nbsp;now&nbsp;consider&nbsp;analytics&nbsp;among&nbsp;the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.nielit.gov.in/NielitMain/DEL" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Data&nbsp;Analytics&nbsp;using&nbsp;Power&nbsp;BI</a>.</p><h2><strong>Common&nbsp;Challenges&nbsp;Arts&nbsp;Students&nbsp;Face</strong></h2><h3><strong>Fear&nbsp;of&nbsp;Technical&nbsp;Subjects</strong></h3><p>Many&nbsp;students&nbsp;assume&nbsp;coding&nbsp;is&nbsp;impossible.</p><p>But&nbsp;beginner&nbsp;analytics&nbsp;usually&nbsp;requires&nbsp;very&nbsp;light&nbsp;technical&nbsp;exposure&nbsp;initially.</p><h3><strong>Lack&nbsp;of&nbsp;Guidance</strong></h3><p>Schools&nbsp;rarely&nbsp;explain&nbsp;modern&nbsp;career&nbsp;paths&nbsp;properly.</p><p>Many&nbsp;students&nbsp;only&nbsp;hear&nbsp;about:</p><ul><li>BA</li><li>UPSC</li><li>Teaching</li><li>Government&nbsp;jobs</li></ul><p>Analytics&nbsp;is&nbsp;still&nbsp;under-discussed&nbsp;in&nbsp;many&nbsp;arts&nbsp;streams.</p><h3><strong>Overpriced&nbsp;Courses</strong></h3><p>Some&nbsp;institutes&nbsp;charge&nbsp;huge&nbsp;fees&nbsp;without&nbsp;proper&nbsp;placement&nbsp;support.</p><p>Before&nbsp;joining&nbsp;any&nbsp;institute:</p><ul><li>Check&nbsp;reviews</li><li>Ask&nbsp;about&nbsp;projects</li><li>Verify&nbsp;mentor&nbsp;background</li><li>Look&nbsp;for&nbsp;real&nbsp;placement&nbsp;proof</li></ul><h2><strong>Why&nbsp;NIDADS&nbsp;Is&nbsp;a&nbsp;Great&nbsp;Choice&nbsp;for&nbsp;Learning&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analytics</strong></h2><p>If&nbsp;you&nbsp;are&nbsp;looking&nbsp;for&nbsp;a&nbsp;data&nbsp;analytics&nbsp;course&nbsp;after&nbsp;12th&nbsp;arts&nbsp;that&nbsp;is&nbsp;totally&nbsp;beginner&nbsp;friendly&nbsp;the&nbsp;NIDADS&nbsp;could&nbsp;be&nbsp;your&nbsp;best&nbsp;choice.&nbsp;This&nbsp;institute&nbsp;emphasises&nbsp;learning&nbsp;with&nbsp;practical&nbsp;exposure&nbsp;instead&nbsp;of&nbsp;only&nbsp;reciting&nbsp;theory.&nbsp;</p><p>Students&nbsp;get&nbsp;hands-on&nbsp;training&nbsp;in&nbsp;tools&nbsp;like:</p><ul><li>Excel</li><li>SQL</li><li>Power&nbsp;BI</li><li>Data&nbsp;Visualization</li></ul><p>What&nbsp;makes&nbsp;NIDADS&nbsp;stand&nbsp;out&nbsp;is&nbsp;its&nbsp;industry-focused&nbsp;approach.&nbsp;Along&nbsp;with&nbsp;technical&nbsp;skills,&nbsp;students&nbsp;also&nbsp;get&nbsp;exposure&nbsp;to&nbsp;live&nbsp;projects,&nbsp;assignments,&nbsp;and&nbsp;portfolio-building&nbsp;activities&nbsp;that&nbsp;help&nbsp;during&nbsp;internships&nbsp;and&nbsp;job&nbsp;interviews.</p><p>The&nbsp;institute&nbsp;is&nbsp;especially&nbsp;helpful&nbsp;for&nbsp;students&nbsp;searching&nbsp;for:</p><ul><li>“How&nbsp;can&nbsp;I&nbsp;become&nbsp;data&nbsp;analyst&nbsp;after&nbsp;12th”</li><li>“Data&nbsp;analytics&nbsp;without&nbsp;maths&nbsp;background”</li></ul><p>NIDADS&nbsp;also&nbsp;provides&nbsp;mentorship,&nbsp;resume&nbsp;guidance,&nbsp;and&nbsp;career&nbsp;support,&nbsp;which&nbsp;many&nbsp;freshers&nbsp;need&nbsp;while&nbsp;entering&nbsp;the&nbsp;analytics&nbsp;field.</p><p>For&nbsp;students&nbsp;looking&nbsp;for&nbsp;practical&nbsp;and&nbsp;affordable&nbsp;<strong><u><a href="https://www.nidads.com/blog/data-analyst-salary-india-2026-guide" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">high&nbsp;salary&nbsp;courses&nbsp;after&nbsp;12th&nbsp;arts</a></u></strong>,&nbsp;NIDADS&nbsp;can&nbsp;be&nbsp;a&nbsp;smart&nbsp;starting&nbsp;point&nbsp;toward&nbsp;a&nbsp;career&nbsp;in&nbsp;data&nbsp;analytics.</p><h2><strong>FAQ&nbsp;Section</strong></h2><p><strong>Can&nbsp;arts&nbsp;students&nbsp;become&nbsp;data&nbsp;analysts?</strong></p><p>Yes,&nbsp;of&nbsp;course,&nbsp;arts&nbsp;students&nbsp;can&nbsp;become&nbsp;data&nbsp;analysts&nbsp;if&nbsp;they&nbsp;gain&nbsp;practical&nbsp;knowledge&nbsp;in&nbsp;tools&nbsp;such&nbsp;as&nbsp;Excel,&nbsp;SQL,&nbsp;and&nbsp;Power&nbsp;BI.&nbsp;And&nbsp;there&nbsp;is&nbsp;no&nbsp;boundary&nbsp;that&nbsp;you&nbsp;have&nbsp;to&nbsp;come&nbsp;from&nbsp;a&nbsp;specific&nbsp;stream&nbsp;to&nbsp;learn&nbsp;these&nbsp;skills;&nbsp;many&nbsp;beginner&nbsp;analytics&nbsp;courses&nbsp;accept&nbsp;students&nbsp;from&nbsp;the&nbsp;arts&nbsp;stream&nbsp;as&nbsp;well.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><strong>How&nbsp;can&nbsp;I&nbsp;become&nbsp;data&nbsp;analyst&nbsp;after&nbsp;12th?</strong></p><p>Start&nbsp;your&nbsp;journey&nbsp;by&nbsp;learning&nbsp;basics&nbsp;of&nbsp;Excel&nbsp;and&nbsp;data&nbsp;visualization.&nbsp;Then&nbsp;move&nbsp;ahed&nbsp;towards&nbsp;SQl&nbsp;and&nbsp;Power&nbsp;BI.&nbsp;And&nbsp;if&nbsp;you&nbsp;want&nbsp;structured&nbsp;learning&nbsp;then&nbsp;you&nbsp;can&nbsp;even&nbsp;pursue&nbsp;a&nbsp;proper&nbsp;diploma&nbsp;course&nbsp;from&nbsp;known&nbsp;institute&nbsp;like&nbsp;NIDADS.&nbsp;Furthermore,&nbsp;your&nbsp;strong&nbsp;portfolio&nbsp;matters&nbsp;a&nbsp;lot,&nbsp;so&nbsp;consider&nbsp;making&nbsp;it&nbsp;more&nbsp;attractive.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Can&nbsp;arts&nbsp;student&nbsp;do&nbsp;data&nbsp;science?</strong></p><p>Yes,&nbsp;but&nbsp;data&nbsp;science&nbsp;usually&nbsp;requires&nbsp;deeper&nbsp;statistics&nbsp;and&nbsp;programming&nbsp;compared&nbsp;to&nbsp;data&nbsp;analytics.&nbsp;Many&nbsp;arts&nbsp;students&nbsp;begin&nbsp;with&nbsp;analytics&nbsp;first&nbsp;and&nbsp;later&nbsp;transition&nbsp;into&nbsp;data&nbsp;science&nbsp;gradually&nbsp;after&nbsp;learning&nbsp;Python&nbsp;and&nbsp;advanced&nbsp;concepts.</p><p><strong>Is&nbsp;maths&nbsp;compulsory&nbsp;for&nbsp;data&nbsp;analytics?</strong></p><p>There&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;little&nbsp;bit&nbsp;of&nbsp;maths,&nbsp;but&nbsp;advanced&nbsp;maths&nbsp;is&nbsp;not&nbsp;compulsory.&nbsp;Only&nbsp;basic&nbsp;statistics&nbsp;and&nbsp;logical&nbsp;reasoning&nbsp;are&nbsp;required&nbsp;to&nbsp;start.&nbsp;Since&nbsp;most&nbsp;modern&nbsp;analytics&nbsp;tools&nbsp;handle&nbsp;calculations&nbsp;automatically,&nbsp;understanding&nbsp;insights&nbsp;and&nbsp;business&nbsp;context&nbsp;becomes&nbsp;more&nbsp;valuable.</p><p><strong>Which&nbsp;is&nbsp;the&nbsp;best&nbsp;diploma&nbsp;course&nbsp;after&nbsp;12th&nbsp;arts&nbsp;for&nbsp;high&nbsp;salary?</strong></p><p>Data&nbsp;analytics,&nbsp;digital&nbsp;marketing,&nbsp;UI/UX&nbsp;design,&nbsp;and&nbsp;business&nbsp;analytics&nbsp;are&nbsp;among&nbsp;the&nbsp;best&nbsp;skill-based&nbsp;diploma&nbsp;courses&nbsp;after&nbsp;12th&nbsp;arts&nbsp;in&nbsp;2026.&nbsp;Analytics&nbsp;stands&nbsp;out&nbsp;because&nbsp;demand&nbsp;continues&nbsp;growing&nbsp;across&nbsp;industries.</p><p><strong>What&nbsp;is&nbsp;the&nbsp;average&nbsp;salary&nbsp;after&nbsp;a&nbsp;data&nbsp;analytics&nbsp;course?</strong></p><p>Freshers&nbsp;in&nbsp;India&nbsp;can&nbsp;expect&nbsp;salaries&nbsp;between&nbsp;₹2.5–5&nbsp;LPA&nbsp;depending&nbsp;on&nbsp;skills,&nbsp;projects,&nbsp;and&nbsp;internships.&nbsp;Candidates&nbsp;with&nbsp;strong&nbsp;portfolios&nbsp;and&nbsp;Power&nbsp;BI&nbsp;expertise&nbsp;often&nbsp;secure&nbsp;better&nbsp;opportunities.</p><p><strong>Can&nbsp;I&nbsp;learn&nbsp;data&nbsp;analytics&nbsp;online&nbsp;for&nbsp;free?</strong></p><p>Yes.&nbsp;Platforms&nbsp;like&nbsp;YouTube,&nbsp;Google&nbsp;Career&nbsp;Certificates,&nbsp;and&nbsp;free&nbsp;tutorials&nbsp;provide&nbsp;excellent&nbsp;beginner&nbsp;resources.&nbsp;However,&nbsp;structured&nbsp;paid&nbsp;courses&nbsp;may&nbsp;help&nbsp;faster&nbsp;with&nbsp;mentorship&nbsp;and&nbsp;placement&nbsp;support.</p><p><strong>Which&nbsp;tools&nbsp;should&nbsp;beginners&nbsp;learn&nbsp;first&nbsp;in&nbsp;data&nbsp;analytics?</strong></p><p>Start&nbsp;with&nbsp;Excel,&nbsp;then&nbsp;learn&nbsp;SQL&nbsp;and&nbsp;Power&nbsp;BI.&nbsp;These&nbsp;three&nbsp;tools&nbsp;alone&nbsp;can&nbsp;help&nbsp;you&nbsp;qualify&nbsp;for&nbsp;many&nbsp;beginner-level&nbsp;analytics&nbsp;jobs&nbsp;and&nbsp;internships&nbsp;in&nbsp;India.</p><h2><strong>Final&nbsp;Thoughts</strong></h2><p>After&nbsp;the&nbsp;12th,&nbsp;<a href="https://www.nielit.gov.in/NielitMain/DEL" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Data&nbsp;Analytics&nbsp;using&nbsp;Python</a><strong><a href="https://www.nielit.gov.in/NielitMain/DEL" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">&nbsp;</a>&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;completely&nbsp;doable&nbsp;course&nbsp;in&nbsp;2026.&nbsp;The&nbsp;field&nbsp;is&nbsp;no&nbsp;longer&nbsp;just&nbsp;for&nbsp;engineering&nbsp;or&nbsp;science&nbsp;students.&nbsp;An&nbsp;art&nbsp;background&nbsp;does&nbsp;not&nbsp;prohibit&nbsp;you&nbsp;from&nbsp;tailoring&nbsp;solid&nbsp;career&nbsp;paths&nbsp;in&nbsp;analytics&nbsp;if&nbsp;you&nbsp;are&nbsp;ready&nbsp;to&nbsp;develop&nbsp;practical&nbsp;skills&nbsp;with&nbsp;consistency.&nbsp;</p><p>The&nbsp;best&nbsp;thing&nbsp;to&nbsp;do&nbsp;is&nbsp;to&nbsp;not&nbsp;worry&nbsp;so&nbsp;much&nbsp;about&nbsp;the&nbsp;limit&nbsp;of&nbsp;streams,&nbsp;and&nbsp;instead&nbsp;focus&nbsp;on&nbsp;project&nbsp;based&nbsp;learning.&nbsp;In&nbsp;entry-level&nbsp;hiring,&nbsp;skills,&nbsp;portfolios&nbsp;and&nbsp;communication&nbsp;now&nbsp;carry&nbsp;far&nbsp;more&nbsp;weight.</p><p>NIDADS&nbsp;can&nbsp;help&nbsp;you&nbsp;choose&nbsp;the&nbsp;right&nbsp;analytics&nbsp;learning&nbsp;path,&nbsp;career-focused&nbsp;certifications,&nbsp;digital&nbsp;skill&nbsp;training&nbsp;with&nbsp;real&nbsp;industry&nbsp;content&nbsp;and&nbsp;expert&nbsp;knowledge&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;subject.</p><h2>About&nbsp;the&nbsp;Author</h2><p><strong>Quick&nbsp;facts</strong></p><p><strong>Name:</strong>&nbsp;Deepanshu</p><p><strong>From:</strong>&nbsp;Delhi</p><p><strong>Education:</strong>&nbsp;MCA</p><p><strong>Program:</strong>&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science&nbsp;and&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analytics</p><p><strong>Placed&nbsp;in:</strong>&nbsp;NIDADS&nbsp;(National&nbsp;Institute&nbsp;of&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analytics&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science)</p><p><strong>Covers&nbsp;topics:&nbsp;</strong>Data&nbsp;Science,&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analytics,&nbsp;Artificial&nbsp;Intelligence,&nbsp;Machine&nbsp;Learning,&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Engineering,&nbsp;Deep&nbsp;Learning</p><p><strong>Currently&nbsp;working&nbsp;as:&nbsp;</strong>Senior&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analyst</p><p><strong>In&nbsp;his&nbsp;words:&nbsp;</strong>&quot;Data&nbsp;doesn&#39;t&nbsp;just&nbsp;tell&nbsp;you&nbsp;what&nbsp;happened&nbsp;—&nbsp;it&nbsp;tells&nbsp;you&nbsp;what&nbsp;to&nbsp;build&nbsp;next.&nbsp;My&nbsp;job&nbsp;is&nbsp;to&nbsp;turn&nbsp;numbers&nbsp;into&nbsp;decisions&nbsp;that&nbsp;actually&nbsp;move&nbsp;the&nbsp;needle.&quot;</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  
</body>
</html>